  "title": "Part I: A mapping of tech in the criminal justice system",
  "summary": "This is the first part in a four-part series Recidiviz has written to summarize some of the biggest issues we see with the use of technology in the criminal justice space and to create a “playbook” with specific recommendations that practitioners can utilize in tech procurement, integration, and deployment. As always, we welcome thoughts and feedback.",
